hed front"}],"work_id":975100060,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300419,"text":"Henry Turner heeft moeite zijn studie te combineren met zijn nieuwe verantwoordelijkheid als aanvoerder van het ijshockeyteam. Halle Jacobs biedt hem hulp aan, terwijl zij zelf vastloopt bij het schrijven van een boek. Hun samenwerking levert beiden iets op dat niet in een studieplanning past. Het derde Maple Hills-boek volgt hoe vriendschap en onderlinge verwachtingen veranderen wanneer praktische afspraken ruimte maken voor persoonlijke gevoelens.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1927414/dagdroom.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789000391516","key":{"isbn_13":"9789000391516"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100061,"title":"Heartstopper","isbn_13":"9789000391516","isbn_10":"9000391512","language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum","id":975200132}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789000391516","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789000391516"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2066700/heartstopper-deel-6.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-nl/literatuur-romans/heartstopper-9789000391516","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000771427_Heartstopper_Deel_6_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:13:01.71Z","sha256":"67aa85b17f35c53148ab3b78ad8597dacb6920dd008eae48a2dd798c9358c17c","bytes":700479,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789000391516","work_id":975100061,"bound_author_id":924300302,"bound_title":"Heartstopper","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789000391516","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000771427_Heartstopper_Deel_6_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2066700/heartstopper-deel-6.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2531:nl","key":{"work_id":975100061,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2066700/heartstopper-deel-6.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-nl/literatuur-romans/heartstopper-9789000391516","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000771427_Heartstopper_Deel_6_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:13:01.71Z","sha256":"67aa85b17f35c53148ab3b78ad8597dacb6920dd008eae48a2dd798c9358c17c","bytes":700479,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100061,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300302,"text":"Nick en Charlie zijn als stel vertrouwd met elkaar, maar een nieuwe levensfase brengt onzekerheid. Charlie richt zich op zijn rol op school, terwijl Nick zich voorbereidt op de universiteit en nadenkt over wie hij buiten hun relatie is. Het zesde Heartstopper-deel volgt hoe zij met die verschillende vooruitzichten omgaan. Hun verbondenheid blijft belangrijk, juist wanneer hun plannen niet langer vanzelf dezelfde richting op lopen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2066700/heartstopper-deel-6.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789000389520","key":{"isbn_13":"9789000389520"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100062,"title":"