ppen en het huis beschadigd raakt. De vrienden hebben weinig tijd om alles recht te zetten. Dit zevende avontuur draait om een ogenschijnlijk eenvoudige gunst die door de eisen van een godin onverwacht gevaarlijk wordt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1914860/percy-jackson-en-de-wraak-van-hecate.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021425368","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021425368"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100064,"title":"Lief meisje, kwaad bloed","isbn_13":"9789021425368","isbn_10":"902142536X","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200135}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021425368","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021425368"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000531429_Lief_meisje_kwaad_bloed_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:13:37.627Z","sha256":"e8bb901d6549259e1acfc9c90276a127a28ecc6a17fb1242143900c0250dffc3","bytes":355846,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021425368","work_id":975100064,"bound_author_id":924300298,"bound_title":"Lief meisje, kwaad bloed","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021425368","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000531429_Lief_meisje_kwaad_bloed_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2207:nl","key":{"work_id":975100064,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000531429_Lief_meisje_kwaad_bloed_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T23:13:37.627Z","sha256":"e8bb901d6549259e1acfc9c90276a127a28ecc6a17fb1242143900c0250dffc3","bytes":355846,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100064,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300298,"text":"Pip heeft besloten geen nieuwe zaken meer te onderzoeken, al werkt ze nog aan haar podcast over een eerdere moordzaak. Wanneer Jamie Reynolds verdwijnt en de politie geen onderzoek begint, vraagt zijn broer haar om hulp. Ze gaat opnieuw op zoek naar bewijs en verborgen verbanden in haar dorp. De roman volgt hoe haar verantwoordelijkheid tegenover een vermiste bekende botst met de grenzen die ze zichzelf had gesteld.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399055/lief-meisje-kwaad-bloed.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024580101","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024580101"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100065,"title":"De held van weleer","isbn_13":"9789024580101","isbn_10":"9024580102","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200136}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024580101","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024580101"},"before":null,"after":{